36
00:02:09,270 --> 00:02:13,310
Episode 23:
The Prodigy Goalkeeper Returns!

37
00:02:09,270 --> 00:02:13,310
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

38
00:02:11,650 --> 00:02:12,520
Tsubasa!

39
00:02:12,520 --> 00:02:13,520
Bastard!

40
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,020
He hit it on purpose!

41
00:02:19,400 --> 00:02:20,110
What?!

42
00:02:20,610 --> 00:02:22,740
The ball went to Misaki-kun.

43
00:02:22,740 --> 00:02:25,810
Hyuga, you won't be the winners.

44
00:02:25,810 --> 00:02:26,990
I will be!

45
00:02:27,820 --> 00:02:28,990
This...

46
00:02:28,990 --> 00:02:30,830
Exactly, Kojiro.

47
00:02:30,830 --> 00:02:32,170
Misaki...

48
00:02:32,170 --> 00:02:35,700
I played many matches with you at Meiwa Elementary.

49
00:02:35,700 --> 00:02:39,440
But I'm playing for Nankatsu SC now, and I'm your opponent.

50
00:02:39,440 --> 00:02:44,850
We'll definitely wave the championship pennant together with Tsubasa-kun!

51
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:45,470
What?!

52
00:02:45,470 --> 00:02:48,220
A long pass to Tsubasa-kun.

53
00:02:49,070 --> 00:02:50,560
Nice, Misaki-kun.

54
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:53,100
That's to be expected from Nankatsu's golden duo.

55
00:02:53,100 --> 00:02:55,780
Tsubasa-kun aims directly for the goal.

56
00:02:55,780 --> 00:02:58,110
The ball heads straight for the top corner.

57
00:02:58,680 --> 00:03:00,590
H-He caught it!

58
00:03:00,590 --> 00:03:01,360
What?!

59
00:03:02,530 --> 00:03:05,580
And with that, he does a somersault!

60
00:03:05,580 --> 00:03:06,960
A wonderful catch!

61
00:03:06,960 --> 00:03:09,430
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun played brilliantly!

62
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:10,870
Nice, Wakashimazu!

63
00:03:10,870 --> 00:03:13,040
You're the man, Wakashimazu!

64
00:03:13,040 --> 00:03:15,780
His performance against Furano wasn't a fluke.

65
00:03:15,780 --> 00:03:19,800
Wakashimazu-kun is a very talented goalkeeper too.

66
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:22,330
I'm sorry, but as long as I'm here...

67
00:03:22,330 --> 00:03:26,140
...I can't let you score a single goal in this match.

68
00:03:26,140 --> 00:03:26,970
What?

69
00:03:26,970 --> 00:03:29,560
Victory belongs to Meiwa!

70
00:03:30,140 --> 00:03:32,690
Will Meiwa attack this time?

71
00:03:32,690 --> 00:03:34,350
I'll score one right away.

72
00:03:34,350 --> 00:03:35,650
Pass to me!

73
00:03:35,650 --> 00:03:36,520
Okay!

74
00:03:36,520 --> 00:03:38,020
First, the opening goal...

75
00:03:38,020 --> 00:03:39,250
Did you think I'd allow it?!

76
00:03:39,250 --> 00:03:39,860
What?!

77
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:42,280
Ishizaki-kun intercepts wonderfully.

78
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,400
I did it!

79
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:45,720
Great job, Ishizaki! Keep it up!

80
00:03:45,720 --> 00:03:47,240
Take it, Taki!

81
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,340
Okay.

82
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:50,920
He sends a quick pass to Taki-kun on the right wing.

83
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,360
Nankatsu attacks once again!

84
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:54,250
They show no mercy!

85
00:03:54,250 --> 00:03:56,920
Stop him! Don't let him cross!

86
00:03:57,980 --> 00:04:01,300
Meiwa steals the ball with a sliding tackle from two players!

87
00:04:03,200 --> 00:04:05,430
However, Misaki-kun gets the ball back.

88
00:04:06,190 --> 00:04:07,970
I will definitely not lose today.

89
00:04:07,970 --> 00:04:11,070
Tsubasa-kun runs towards the goal.

90
00:04:11,070 --> 00:04:11,770
Mark him!

91
00:04:11,770 --> 00:04:15,270
Nankatsu aims to score once again through their golden duo.

92
00:04:15,270 --> 00:04:16,900
Cross!

93
00:04:18,650 --> 00:04:21,570
No, Tsubasa-kun was just a decoy.

94
00:04:22,030 --> 00:04:22,780
Got it!

95
00:04:24,060 --> 00:04:24,920
What?!

96
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:28,620
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun catches the ball!

97
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:31,870
Another great save.

98
00:04:31,870 --> 00:04:32,440
Damn it!

99
00:04:32,450 --> 00:04:34,470
While Tsubasa-kun drew the defense...

100
00:04:34,470 --> 00:04:38,920
...Wakashimazu-kun was the only one who calmly read their strategy.

101
00:04:38,920 --> 00:04:41,670
This goalkeeper is a tough nut.

102
00:04:41,670 --> 00:04:45,170
Not just his catching ability, his decision-making is also great.

103
00:04:45,170 --> 00:04:48,760
I guess I'm the third-choice goalkeeper.

104
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:51,060
No wonder he could stop my penalty.

105
00:04:51,560 --> 00:04:53,560
This is as far as Nankatsu goes!

106
00:04:53,560 --> 00:04:56,500
Let's do this, Captain!

107
00:04:58,990 --> 00:05:00,730
Nice pass, Wakashimazu.

108
00:05:00,730 --> 00:05:03,480
Alright, if Hyuga-kun got it, he'll score.

109
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:06,440
Stop him! Don't let Hyuga pass!

110
00:05:06,440 --> 00:05:08,290
Go, Nankatsu!

111
00:05:08,290 --> 00:05:09,910
Stop me if you can!

112
00:05:09,910 --> 00:05:12,370
I'll show you all my strength!

113
00:05:12,370 --> 00:05:16,120
Nankatsu tries to stop his dribble with two players.

114
00:05:16,120 --> 00:05:17,570
You...

115
00:05:20,000 --> 00:05:23,060
Hyuga-kun breaks through with power!

116
00:05:23,060 --> 00:05:27,170
This is Hyuga-kun's strength! What a determined boy!

117
00:05:27,170 --> 00:05:28,340
Takeshi!

118
00:05:28,340 --> 00:05:31,760
Hyuga-kun passes to Sawada-kun, running towards the goal.

119
00:05:32,430 --> 00:05:38,080
If Nankatsu has the duo Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun, Meiwa has the duo Hyuga-kun and Sawada-kun.

120
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:38,940
Hyuga-san!

121
00:05:38,940 --> 00:05:40,120
Alright!

122
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,060
Oh no!

123
00:05:41,060 --> 00:05:43,400
Hyuga-kun receives the pass in front of the goal!

124
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:46,080
Take that, Nankatsu!

125
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:48,780
What?!

126
00:05:48,780 --> 00:05:49,870
He saved it!

127
00:05:49,870 --> 00:05:52,910
Goalkeeper Wakabayashi-kun catches the ball firmly!

128
00:05:55,330 --> 00:05:58,270
That's to be expected from Wakabayashi-kun.

129
00:05:58,270 --> 00:06:03,630
Exactly. If Meiwa has Wakashimazu-kun, Nankatsu has Wakabayashi-kun.

130
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:10,760
With his already national-level talent, a lot is expected of Wakabayashi Genzo-kun for Japanese football.

131
00:06:10,760 --> 00:06:14,220
He jumped and saved it wonderfully.

132
00:06:12,240 --> 00:06:14,220
That's it, Wakabayashi-san!

133
00:06:14,220 --> 00:06:18,230
Wakabayashi Genzo parried the Captain like that...

134
00:06:18,230 --> 00:06:22,890
Hyuga, I'll settle my debt to you right here.

135
00:06:22,890 --> 00:06:24,730
I will definitely not lose!

136
00:06:24,730 --> 00:06:27,510
Damn it! Just watch, Wakabayashi!

137
00:06:27,510 --> 00:06:30,110
I'll definitely score against you!

138
00:06:30,110 --> 00:06:32,410
I'm counting on you, guys!

139
00:06:32,410 --> 00:06:35,620
Both goalkeepers are really good, aren't they?

140
00:06:35,620 --> 00:06:39,580
Neither Hyuga-kun nor Tsubasa-kun will score easily today.

141
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:41,020
Good then.

142
00:06:41,020 --> 00:06:41,790
What?

143
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:46,760
The forward for Toho Academy must be a brilliant star forward...

144
00:06:46,760 --> 00:06:49,880
...who can score even against the best goalkeepers.

145
00:06:49,880 --> 00:06:51,400
Tsubasa-kun!

146
00:06:52,430 --> 00:06:53,800
We won't allow it!

147
00:06:54,840 --> 00:06:56,510
Tsubasa-kun feints!

148
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:59,520
He runs quickly towards Meiwa's goal.

149
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:01,580
Think carefully, Tsubasa.

150
00:07:01,580 --> 00:07:04,910
You can't beat that goalkeeper just by kicking the ball.

151
00:07:04,910 --> 00:07:07,180
In football, you need to use your imagination.

152
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:11,280
You must use everything and everyone on the field to your advantage.

153
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:13,530
This time, I'll definitely score the first goal!

154
00:07:15,280 --> 00:07:17,870
Tsubasa-kun gets into shooting position.

155
00:07:17,870 --> 00:07:20,040
What kind of shot will he take, I wonder?

156
00:07:20,040 --> 00:07:22,210
Alright, bring it on from wherever you want!

157
00:07:23,550 --> 00:07:25,700
What?! He misses the ball!

158
00:07:25,700 --> 00:07:26,250
What?!

159
00:07:27,750 --> 00:07:29,740
No, he did it on purpose.

160
00:07:29,740 --> 00:07:33,940
Wakashimazu-kun falls for Tsubasa-kun's trick and loses his balance.

161
00:07:33,940 --> 00:07:34,840
Oh no!

162
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,010
Wakashimazu!

163
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:39,430
Misaki-kun shoots!

164
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:41,400
What?!

165
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:45,270
Wakashimazu-kun, even though he lost his balance, clears the ball with his foot!

166
00:07:45,270 --> 00:07:47,060
Nice, Wakashimazu!

167
00:07:47,600 --> 00:07:49,480
Meiwa can't follow up on the ball.

168
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:52,740
It goes to Taki-kun, the crossing specialist.

169
00:07:52,740 --> 00:07:53,570
That's it!

170
00:07:53,570 --> 00:07:54,610
I'm counting on you, Tsubasa!

171
00:07:54,610 --> 00:07:55,910
This time...

172
00:07:57,870 --> 00:08:00,240
Tsubasa-kun fires a direct shot!

173
00:08:00,950 --> 00:08:02,710
H-He caught it!

174
00:08:02,710 --> 00:08:04,710
H-How...

175
00:08:04,710 --> 00:08:05,460
Wakashimazu!

176
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,340
It was a breathtaking play!

177
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:10,620
He did it!

178
00:08:10,620 --> 00:08:15,220
He used the goal post to jump to the opposite side and caught it perfectly.

179
00:08:15,840 --> 00:08:18,620
His amazing playing style leaves everyone speechless!

180
00:08:19,460 --> 00:08:21,140
That's to be expected from Wakashimazu.

181
00:08:21,140 --> 00:08:24,780
The blood of karate practitioners runs in his veins.

182
00:08:24,780 --> 00:08:30,520
He owes these sharp reflexes to the karate he learned before elementary school.

183
00:08:30,520 --> 00:08:36,660
The way he used the goal post was an adaptation of the triple kick from karate.

184
00:08:41,480 --> 00:08:43,230
Wakashimazu Ken...

185
00:08:43,230 --> 00:08:47,750
To overcome this goalkeeper, I have no choice but to do an overhead kick.

186
00:08:50,580 --> 00:08:52,200
Ozora Tsubasa...

187
00:08:54,160 --> 00:08:54,920
Hyuga-san!

188
00:08:55,830 --> 00:08:57,680
You won't stand in my way this time!

189
00:08:57,680 --> 00:08:58,680
I'm going to score!

190
00:08:59,840 --> 00:09:02,100
Wakabayashi-kun jumps and catches it!

191
00:09:02,100 --> 00:09:03,100
What?!

192
00:09:04,060 --> 00:09:09,990
Exactly. Wakabayashi-kun is a prodigy goalkeeper who can save any shot taken from outside the penalty area.

193
00:09:09,990 --> 00:09:12,360
...a prodigy goalkeeper.

194
00:09:13,390 --> 00:09:15,240
See that, Hyuga?

195
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:18,720
Even Tsubasa couldn't score against him from outside the box.

196
00:09:18,720 --> 00:09:21,330
It's impossible for you, understand!

197
00:09:23,950 --> 00:09:26,710
Even Tsubasa?

198
00:09:27,790 --> 00:09:29,500
I'm glad to hear that.

199
00:09:29,500 --> 00:09:33,670
So if I can score from outside the penalty area...

200
00:09:33,670 --> 00:09:38,180
...I'll prove I'm better than Tsubasa.

201
00:09:38,180 --> 00:09:41,460
We're in the 10th minute of the first half, and thanks to Wakashimazu-kun and Wakabayashi-kun's efforts...

202
00:09:41,460 --> 00:09:44,800
...the score is 0-0.

203
00:09:44,800 --> 00:09:48,640
Which team will score the first goal?

204
00:09:48,640 --> 00:09:54,530
Since our first match, each of them has greatly improved their skills.

205
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:57,780
But we will be the winners!

206
00:10:01,370 --> 00:10:04,390
Tsubasa being marked is an ordinary event.

207
00:10:04,390 --> 00:10:05,830
Then it's my lucky day!

208
00:10:05,830 --> 00:10:10,580
Alright! As Kisugi Teppei, I'll handle the scoring!

209
00:10:10,580 --> 00:10:11,330
Tsubasa-kun!

210
00:10:12,000 --> 00:10:14,550
A pass comes to Tsubasa-kun in front of the goal.

211
00:10:14,550 --> 00:10:17,720
Damn it! Even though we're marking him, this...

212
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,720
Alright!

213
00:10:18,720 --> 00:10:20,590
Will Tsubasa-kun be able to score this time?

214
00:10:20,590 --> 00:10:23,540
Or will goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun stop him once again?

215
00:10:23,540 --> 00:10:24,600
Come!

216
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:29,020
No. If I shoot this, it won't beat Wakashimazu-kun.

217
00:10:29,020 --> 00:10:30,020
Tsubasa!

218
00:10:30,020 --> 00:10:31,440
Kisugi-kun!

219
00:10:33,250 --> 00:10:38,650
Even though Tsubasa-kun is in a position to shoot, he shifts his body position and passes!

220
00:10:38,650 --> 00:10:39,570
What?!

221
00:10:39,570 --> 00:10:42,280
A wonderful decision.

222
00:10:42,280 --> 00:10:44,450
Alright, I've got this!

223
00:10:44,450 --> 00:10:45,450
Oh no!

224
00:10:45,450 --> 00:10:48,530
Nankatsu's hidden weapon, Kisugi-kun, shoots!

225
00:10:50,530 --> 00:10:51,280
What?!

226
00:10:51,280 --> 00:10:53,460
It's not a goal!

227
00:10:53,460 --> 00:10:55,140
What kind of reflexes are these?!

228
00:10:55,140 --> 00:10:57,250
Wakashimazu-kun clears the shot!

229
00:10:57,250 --> 00:10:58,880
Nice, Wakashimazu-san!

230
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,470
Isn't even this enough?!

231
00:11:00,470 --> 00:11:03,470
That's it! I'll do an overhead kick on this ball!

232
00:11:03,470 --> 00:11:06,970
This stance is the preparation for an overhead kick!

233
00:11:06,970 --> 00:11:09,980
Wakashimazu-kun hasn't gotten up yet!

234
00:11:09,980 --> 00:11:12,400
I won't allow it!

235
00:11:12,400 --> 00:11:15,940
An aerial overhead kick battle!

236
00:11:23,300 --> 00:11:30,000
Hyuga-kun brilliantly stops Tsubasa-kun's overhead kick with his own overhead kick!

237
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:30,750
Captain!

238
00:11:30,750 --> 00:11:31,210
Tsubasa!

239
00:11:31,210 --> 00:11:33,750
I can't let this ball go to waste.

240
00:11:33,750 --> 00:11:35,250
I'll score the goal!

241
00:11:35,250 --> 00:11:36,920
Bring it on!

242
00:11:38,520 --> 00:11:40,170
Ball...

243
00:11:41,170 --> 00:11:42,920
Shoot...

244
00:11:44,070 --> 00:11:45,420
Shoot...

245
00:11:46,580 --> 00:11:47,460
...I have to shoot!

246
00:11:47,460 --> 00:11:47,890
What?!

247
00:11:48,640 --> 00:11:50,020
Tsubasa-kun!

248
00:11:50,020 --> 00:11:50,890
What?!

249
00:11:54,050 --> 00:11:59,690
Misaki-kun and Tsubasa-kun shoot together!

250
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,580
What?

251
00:12:03,580 --> 00:12:04,450
Ball...

252
00:12:12,090 --> 00:12:13,700
Goal!

253
00:12:13,700 --> 00:12:16,880
Goalkeeper Wakashimazu-kun can't react to this shot.

254
00:12:16,880 --> 00:12:20,380
In the 12th minute of the first half, Nankatsu scores the first goal.

255
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:23,380
- They did it!
- They did it! They scored the first goal!

256
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:25,380
It went in...

257
00:12:25,380 --> 00:12:27,120
We did it, Tsubasa-kun!

258
00:12:27,120 --> 00:12:29,030
We scored our first goal!

259
00:12:29,030 --> 00:12:30,140
Y-Yes.

260
00:12:30,140 --> 00:12:34,960
When I fell and hit my head, I couldn't see you were going to shoot.

261
00:12:34,960 --> 00:12:37,650
But we really scored a goal, didn't we?

262
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:40,160
You did it, Tsubasa, Misaki!

263
00:12:40,160 --> 00:12:41,140
Everyone!

264
00:12:41,140 --> 00:12:43,440
It was an amazing shot!

265
00:12:43,440 --> 00:12:46,000
Because Tsubasa-kun and Misaki-kun hit the ball together...

266
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:47,690
...the ball followed a different trajectory...

267
00:12:47,690 --> 00:12:50,990
...and it was hard to track since it was moving so fast.

268
00:12:50,990 --> 00:12:53,700
Even Wakashimazu-kun, who showed such wonderful defense...

269
00:12:53,700 --> 00:12:57,750
...couldn't manage to stop this shot.

270
00:12:57,750 --> 00:13:00,730
This shot was a masterpiece.

271
00:13:00,730 --> 00:13:02,710
That's to be expected from Tsubasa and Misaki.

272
00:13:03,240 --> 00:13:05,450
I've been watching football for years...

273
00:13:05,450 --> 00:13:08,220
...but I'm seeing a shot like this for the first time!

274
00:13:08,220 --> 00:13:12,010
You finally did it, Tsubasa, Misaki.

275
00:13:12,660 --> 00:13:16,270
Damn it! How could I not react to that shot?

276
00:13:16,790 --> 00:13:17,980
Damn it!

277
00:13:17,980 --> 00:13:19,730
Wakashimazu-san...

278
00:13:20,290 --> 00:13:21,440
No problem.

279
00:13:21,440 --> 00:13:24,530
Forget about that goal, Wakashimazu.

280
00:13:24,530 --> 00:13:28,070
They won't be able to take a shot like that again.

281
00:13:28,070 --> 00:13:30,120
It was a fluke.

282
00:13:30,120 --> 00:13:31,160
Captain...

283
00:13:31,160 --> 00:13:35,700
I will definitely get that goal back.

284
00:13:39,040 --> 00:13:44,050
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
AreyousureSubs Presents

285
00:13:45,160 --> 00:13:47,600
Under the scorching heat...

286
00:13:47,600 --> 00:13:52,850
...down by one goal, what kind of attack will Meiwa FC display?

287
00:13:52,850 --> 00:13:54,580
"If you concede one, pay it back."

288
00:13:54,580 --> 00:13:56,390
That's the golden rule of a battle.

289
00:13:56,390 --> 00:13:58,380
I'm counting on you, Kojiro.

290
00:13:59,900 --> 00:14:03,940
I will protect this goal at all costs.

291
00:14:04,820 --> 00:14:06,570
I'm coming, Nankatsu!

292
00:14:06,570 --> 00:14:08,840
Hyuga-kun attacks fiercely!

293
00:14:08,840 --> 00:14:11,340
Did conceding a goal ignite his fighting spirit?

294
00:14:11,340 --> 00:14:12,830
A great drive!

295
00:14:12,830 --> 00:14:14,360
We won't let you pass!

296
00:14:14,360 --> 00:14:16,500
Nankatsu is trying to defend with determination!

297
00:14:17,380 --> 00:14:19,080
He slides very sharply!

298
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:26,010
With his giant-like power and foresight, Hyuga-kun gets through!

299
00:14:26,010 --> 00:14:28,170
Nankatsu can't stop him!

300
00:14:28,170 --> 00:14:30,100
That's it! Go, Hyuga!

301
00:14:30,100 --> 00:14:31,930
You'll take the equalizing shot!

302
00:14:31,930 --> 00:14:34,430
Kojiro's dribbling is truly amazing.

303
00:14:34,430 --> 00:14:37,980
I used to see it very often when I played at Meiwa.

304
00:14:37,980 --> 00:14:40,730
The minutes after scoring are very crucial.

305
00:14:40,730 --> 00:14:42,520
I'll stop you no matter what, Kojiro!

306
00:14:43,850 --> 00:14:46,320
Misaki-kun slides in to tackle!

307
00:14:46,820 --> 00:14:50,800
But Sawada-kun gets the ball back!

308
00:14:50,800 --> 00:14:51,530
Hyuga-san!

309
00:14:53,140 --> 00:14:54,700
This is a huge chance!

310
00:14:56,740 --> 00:14:59,580
Is he going to take a long shot again?

311
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:00,800
I'll score!

312
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:04,360
I'll score a goal by shooting from outside the penalty area!

313
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:05,540
Take this!

314
00:15:05,540 --> 00:15:09,170
There! Hyuga-kun's bullet-like shot!

315
00:15:09,170 --> 00:15:12,590
The ball heads towards the goal with a terrifying sound!

316
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:13,680
Wakabayashi-kun!

317
00:15:13,680 --> 00:15:15,470
No matter how much you try, it'll be the same!

318
00:15:15,470 --> 00:15:17,680
It doesn't work on me!

319
00:15:18,420 --> 00:15:19,660
He caught it!

320
00:15:19,660 --> 00:15:21,740
He jumps and catches it wonderfully!

321
00:15:21,740 --> 00:15:24,860
Hyuga-kun's 3rd attempt also comes to nothing.

322
00:15:25,860 --> 00:15:28,460
Even if he's not as flashy as Wakashimazu-kun...

323
00:15:28,460 --> 00:15:31,110
...his defense is definitely rock solid.

324
00:15:31,110 --> 00:15:34,120
Nankatsu goalkeeper Wakabayashi Genzo-kun.

325
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,690
Exactly, Genzo.

326
00:15:35,690 --> 00:15:40,750
The most important thing for a goalkeeper is a rock-solid, error-free playing style.

327
00:15:40,750 --> 00:15:44,180
I couldn't convert on 3 attempts.

328
00:15:44,180 --> 00:15:45,210
Damn it!

329
00:15:48,100 --> 00:15:51,170
Hyuga-kun takes a long shot from outside the penalty area!

330
00:15:51,740 --> 00:15:54,720
But Wakabayashi-kun jumps and catches this one too!

331
00:15:58,930 --> 00:16:01,020
That's to be expected from Wakabayashi-san!

332
00:16:01,020 --> 00:16:05,040
If it were me, I would have conceded all those great shots.

333
00:16:05,040 --> 00:16:06,190
Yeah, yeah.

334
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:08,940
Your leg seems to have healed, Wakabayashi.

335
00:16:09,830 --> 00:16:10,980
Damn it!

336
00:16:10,980 --> 00:16:11,690
Captain...

337
00:16:11,690 --> 00:16:15,040
Why are you so fixated on shooting from outside the box?

338
00:16:15,780 --> 00:16:17,430
On purpose?

339
00:16:17,430 --> 00:16:18,330
Probably.

340
00:16:18,330 --> 00:16:25,240
Wakabayashi-kun became legendary for never conceding a goal from outside the penalty area.

341
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:31,180
Hyuga-kun desperately wants to crush that title to prove his own talent.

342
00:16:31,180 --> 00:16:35,050
But it's a mistake a forward would make.

343
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:41,790
Frankly speaking, today's Hyuga-kun failed the test to become Toho Academy's star forward.

344
00:16:43,140 --> 00:16:44,730
Kojiro...

345
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:48,480
Hora! Hora! Nankatsu!

346
00:16:44,730 --> 00:16:49,060
Less than a minute left in the first half.

347
00:16:48,920 --> 00:16:50,550
Score, Hyuga!

348
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:53,900
Meiwa attacks continuously as they want to equalize before the first half ends!

349
00:16:50,550 --> 00:16:51,730
Only one minute left!

350
00:16:53,900 --> 00:16:54,650
Send it to me!

351
00:16:56,240 --> 00:16:57,030
Captain!

352
00:16:57,480 --> 00:17:00,280
Meiwa sends the ball to Hyuga-kun one last time.

353
00:17:00,280 --> 00:17:04,100
This time I'll score!

354
00:17:04,100 --> 00:17:07,250
The last shot also comes from outside the penalty area.

355
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,960
Take this!

356
00:17:10,880 --> 00:17:12,170
A powerful shot!

357
00:17:12,170 --> 00:17:15,720
Will Wakabayashi-kun be able to catch this one too?

358
00:17:15,720 --> 00:17:19,260
There's another player in the path of the shot!

359
00:17:19,800 --> 00:17:21,660
Sawada-kun!

360
00:17:21,660 --> 00:17:24,560
Wakabayashi-kun is caught off guard!

361
00:17:24,560 --> 00:17:25,270
Oh no!

362
00:17:26,060 --> 00:17:27,020
I did it!

363
00:17:27,020 --> 00:17:31,400
Will Meiwa equalize before the first half ends?

364
00:17:32,650 --> 00:17:34,570
Wakabayashi-kun!

365
00:17:34,570 --> 00:17:40,270
By placing his hand on the ground and pushing his body up, he barely manages to clear the ball!

366
00:17:42,620 --> 00:17:43,840
Wakabayashi-kun!

367
00:17:43,840 --> 00:17:46,210
The referee blows the whistle to end the first half.

368
00:17:46,210 --> 00:17:51,040
Wakabayashi-kun defended the Nankatsu goal wonderfully, without conceding a goal.

369
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:55,340
But Wakashimazu-kun also played brilliantly, even though he conceded one.

370
00:17:55,340 --> 00:17:59,120
It wouldn't be an exaggeration to say the first half was a battle of goalkeepers.

371
00:18:00,340 --> 00:18:02,410
Well done, everyone.

372
00:18:02,410 --> 00:18:03,470
Yes!

373
00:18:03,470 --> 00:18:07,480
The shot Tsubasa and Misaki took together was amazing.

374
00:18:08,480 --> 00:18:13,610
Officially, it's counted as Misaki's assist and Tsubasa's goal.

375
00:18:13,610 --> 00:18:16,170
So Tsubasa has 28 goals!

376
00:18:16,170 --> 00:18:20,110
He's one goal ahead of Hyuga in the goal king race and at the top!

377
00:18:20,110 --> 00:18:21,870
Don't lose to Hyuga!

378
00:18:22,420 --> 00:18:26,540
Honestly, there's something I want more than being at the top.

379
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:29,890
The championship pennant.

380
00:18:29,890 --> 00:18:35,420
Because haven't we all worked so hard together to win the championship pennant until now?

381
00:18:35,420 --> 00:18:39,930
We've come this far. Let's win no matter what, everyone!

382
00:18:41,800 --> 00:18:43,550
Tsubasa...

383
00:18:43,550 --> 00:18:45,290
Yes, absolutely!

384
00:18:45,290 --> 00:18:47,550
After coming this far, I don't want to lose!

385
00:18:47,550 --> 00:18:49,770
We owe Meiwa from the first match anyway.

386
00:18:50,340 --> 00:18:58,400
Tsubasa, you're a better captain than I ever was at Nankatsu SC.

387
00:18:58,400 --> 00:18:59,900
It was about to go in.

388
00:19:00,520 --> 00:19:02,760
That shot was very close.

389
00:19:02,760 --> 00:19:03,410
Yes.

390
00:19:03,870 --> 00:19:04,650
Takeshi.

391
00:19:04,650 --> 00:19:05,820
Yes?

392
00:19:05,820 --> 00:19:07,680
Don't do something like that again.

393
00:19:09,500 --> 00:19:11,220
Captain...

394
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:14,420
Hyuga-san.

395
00:19:14,420 --> 00:19:18,760
I'll be frank. The football you played today was not Meiwa football.

396
00:19:18,760 --> 00:19:20,090
What?!

397
00:19:20,090 --> 00:19:23,740
Meiwa football is a football based on winning no matter what.

398
00:19:23,740 --> 00:19:28,560
Yet today's Hyuga-san just kept shooting from outside the penalty area.

399
00:19:28,560 --> 00:19:30,770
It definitely wasn't Meiwa football!

400
00:19:33,380 --> 00:19:34,650
Hyuga-san!

401
00:19:35,220 --> 00:19:36,440
Takeshi...

402
00:19:37,310 --> 00:19:39,690
Y-Yes?

403
00:19:40,830 --> 00:19:43,450
You're right.

404
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:50,240
It's true that I was hasty in today's match.

405
00:19:50,240 --> 00:19:54,680
Frankly, this match determines whether I get into Toho Academy or not.

406
00:19:54,680 --> 00:19:55,900
What?!

407
00:19:55,900 --> 00:19:58,900
Toho Academy, the famous one for football?

408
00:19:58,900 --> 00:19:59,340
Yes.

409
00:20:00,140 --> 00:20:03,430
They wanted to recruit me at the end of the first match.

410
00:20:03,430 --> 00:20:09,940
They said all my educational expenses until university would be covered.

411
00:20:09,940 --> 00:20:15,480
Since my father died, the housework has been on me since I was 5.

412
00:20:16,220 --> 00:20:18,730
Frankly, I was very surprised.

413
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:23,590
But at that time, they also said they were watching Ozora Tsubasa.

414
00:20:23,590 --> 00:20:27,240
In short, I think they'll choose whoever wins this match.

415
00:20:27,240 --> 00:20:30,980
So, to prove I'm better than Tsubasa...

416
00:20:30,980 --> 00:20:34,830
...I kept shooting from outside the penalty area.

417
00:20:34,830 --> 00:20:38,090
But that was a mistake.

418
00:20:38,090 --> 00:20:40,440
I was hasty.

419
00:20:40,440 --> 00:20:43,190
I realized it when Takeshi said it.

420
00:20:43,190 --> 00:20:44,470
Hyuga-san...

421
00:20:47,120 --> 00:20:51,340
In the second half, I'll score against Wakabayashi at all costs!

422
00:20:51,340 --> 00:20:54,140
This is Meiwa's winning-based football!

423
00:20:54,140 --> 00:20:56,520
We'll definitely turn this around!

424
00:20:56,520 --> 00:20:57,650
Hyuga-san!

425
00:20:59,150 --> 00:21:00,450
Captain!

426
00:21:00,450 --> 00:21:01,330
Exactly!

427
00:21:01,330 --> 00:21:02,760
Let's do this, Hyuga-san!

428
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:05,580
Meiwa will be the winner!

429
00:21:05,580 --> 00:21:09,660
Without anyone noticing, the team became a whole.

430
00:21:09,660 --> 00:21:14,040
By rallying around their pillar, Kojiro...

431
00:21:14,040 --> 00:21:16,920
...all 11 players turned into one person.

432
00:21:16,920 --> 00:21:22,420
Meiwa FC... There's no reason for this team not to be champions.

433
00:21:23,140 --> 00:21:25,630
Isn't that right, everyone?

434
00:21:25,630 --> 00:21:26,680
Come on, let's do this!

435
00:21:26,680 --> 00:21:30,680
The halftime break is over, and the players of both teams have come out onto the field.

436
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:33,270
Only 20 minutes left.

437
00:21:36,340 --> 00:21:37,900
Only 20 minutes.

438
00:21:37,900 --> 00:21:41,900
If I win, we'll go to Brazil, Roberto.

439
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,000
Mom! Hurry up!

440
00:21:45,000 --> 00:21:48,190
Big brother Kojiro's match has already started!

441
00:21:48,190 --> 00:21:49,530
Okay, okay.

442
00:21:49,530 --> 00:21:51,960
The second half begins.

443
00:21:51,960 --> 00:21:53,520
Nankatsu leads by one goal.

444
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:57,290
Can they keep this up and capture the championship pennant?

445
00:21:57,290 --> 00:22:01,940
Or will Meiwa turn things around in the second half and become champions?

446
00:22:01,940 --> 00:22:03,900
Look, it's my big brother!

447
00:22:06,320 --> 00:22:07,720
Kojiro...

448
00:22:09,470 --> 00:22:10,760
Alright!

449
00:22:10,760 --> 00:22:14,770
Let's show Meiwa's true football in the second half!

450
00:22:14,770 --> 00:22:15,820
Yes!

